Keyboard shortcuts arrive: tap a key to switch tools, hold Space to pan and Alt to pick a color, and hold Shift to keep lines and moves straight. Hold Ctrl, or open Menu > Keyboard, to see every shortcut. The layer sheet now shows a live mini stack, and the + button inserts above the active layer. Rename your artwork right from the menu. Gradients now blend over the layer instead of replacing it, and replays show transparency as a checkerboard. Plus fixes and polish.